              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಜಮಖಾನವನ್ನು ಹೊರಗೆ ಝಾಡಿಸಿದರು. ajji jamakhānavannu horage jhāḍisidaru. Grandmother shook out the rug outside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಝಾಡಿಸಿದೆ, jhāḍiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To shake or beat the dust out of something."
            }
          ]
        },
